# Eliminate the Impossible: "Investigate. Creatures your opponents control get -2/-0 until end of turn. If any of them are suspected, they're no longer suspected."
# Bot1 suspects Bot2's Grizzly Bears (menace, can't block) with J. Jonah Jameson, then casts Eliminate the Impossible on turn 3: Bot1 investigates (a Clue token), both of Bot2's creatures
# get -2/-0 (Bears 2 -> 0, Memnite 1 -> -1) and the Bears are no longer suspected (CR 701.60); Bot1's own Jameson is untouched (2 power). The pump lasts until end of turn only
# (CR 611.2c): on turn 4 the Bears are back to 2 power and still not suspected, the Memnite to 1.

